bability of selection to provide annualized national estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A direct variance estimation procedure was used to calculate 95% confidence intervals and to account for the complex sample design\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"National estimates might be unstable because they are based on <20 cases or coefficient of variation is >30%.\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Rates should be interpreted with caution because of high percentage of unknowns.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}